{"id":"adc0aa731119457e","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md","title":"Fixed Point Theorem","display":"df-fixed-point-theorem — Fixed Point Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-fixed-point-theorem","aliases":["90-df-fixed-point-theorem"],"display":"df-fixed-point-theorem — Fixed Point Theorem","depends_on":["[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-fixed-point-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-fixed-point-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fixed-point-theorem — Fixed Point Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g,d,v,T\">\\(S,g,d,v,T\\)</span> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的环境相同；涉及固定点的可证性是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的有限推导，公式在数码处的取值记法展开为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a> 的自由代入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (fixed arithmetical signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,d\">\\(g,d\\)</span> (effective encoding and partial decoder)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\)</span> (explicit sufficient condition, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(P(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (formula with one designated free variable, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}theorem}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall P(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\nP(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}theorem}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall P(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\nP(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(x)\">\\(P(x)\\)</span>的不动点</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\varphi)\">\\(g(\\varphi)\\)</span> : 相对于已固定有效编号的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的 Gödel 数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>等价于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>应用于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>自己的编码</li>\n<li>也称为&quot;对角化引理&quot;或&quot;自引用引理&quot; (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实际见证及完整证明直接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的证明段；本文件保留原固定点定理接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,g,d,v,T$ 与 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 的环境相同；涉及固定点的可证性是 [[90-df-predicate-logic]] 的有限推导，公式在数码处的取值记法展开为 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的自由代入。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resol